1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Heritage Atlas begins with a simple promise: never lose your family's stories.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The experience starts securely. A family signs in, and their archive opens as a living workspace.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Inside the Vault, the family gets an immediate picture of memories, people, dates, places, and stories.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The Family Map turns relatives into a visual constellation connected across branches and generations.

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The Heritage Atlas Agent turns questions into answers you can see: charts, maps, timelines, and relationship diagrams.

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Every answer is computed in your browser directly from the archive, so nothing is invented and nothing leaves your device.

7
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Ask where the family lived, who appears most often, or how the story unfolded, and the archive becomes visual.

8
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Heritage Atlas is the visual answer layer: explorable, evidence-led, and built beyond the wall of text.

9
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Story Mode turns the same evidence into a guided narrative, with every chapter tied back to source memories.

10
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,410
This is Heritage Atlas: family history made searchable, visual, and alive.
